  "description": "Count down the days until Christmas with this stunning laser cut Advent Calendar Tree, featuring 25 mini wooden houses arranged in the shape of a Christmas tree!\nEach little house is beautifully detailed with engraved numbers and a roofed design — perfect for holding small gifts, candies, or daily surprises. The structure includes decorative cutouts of stars and angels, creating a warm and festive centerpiece for your home or holiday display.\nDesigned for easy assembly and precision cutting on xTool, OMTech, and other laser machines, this 3D model is both practical and magical — a keepsake that can be reused year after year.\n✔️ 25 numbered wooden houses for daily surprises\n✔️ Assembles into a Christmas tree shape\n✔️ Intricate engraved details with stars and angels\n✔️ Works with plywood, MDF, or acrylic\n✔️ Designed for 3 mm (1/8”) material thickness\n✔️ Perfect for Christmas decor, advent gifts, or craft fairs\n✔️ Ready-to-cut files: SVG, DXF, AI, CDR, PDF, EPS, DWG\n📏 Dimensions:\n• Individual house: 53 × 56 × 70 mm (≈ 2.1 × 2.2 × 2.8 in)\n• Largest element: 227 × 322 mm (≈ 8.9 × 12.7 in)\n• Full assembled tree: 663 × 450 mm (≈ 26 × 17.7 in)\nAssembly: Slot-fit structure – no glue required.\nCelebrate the countdown to Christmas with this enchanting Advent Calendar Tree — a perfect DIY project for laser artists, makers, and families who love festive traditions!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Count down the days until Christmas with this stunning laser cut Advent Calendar Tree, featuring 25 mini wooden houses arranged in the shape of a Christmas tree!</p>\n<p>Each little house is beautifully detailed with engraved numbers and a roofed design — perfect for holding small gifts, candies, or daily surprises. The structure includes decorative cutouts of stars and angels, creating a warm and festive centerpiece for your home or holiday display.</p>\n<p>Designed for easy assembly and precision cutting on xTool, OMTech, and other laser machines, this 3D model is both practical and magical — a keepsake that can be reused year after year.</p>\n<p>✔️ 25 numbered wooden houses for daily surprises<br>\n✔️ Assembles into a Christmas tree shape<br>\n✔️ Intricate engraved details with stars and angels<br>\n✔️ Works with plywood, MDF, or acrylic<br>\n✔️ Designed for 3 mm (1/8”) material thickness<br>\n✔️ Perfect for Christmas decor, advent gifts, or craft fairs<br>\n✔️ Ready-to-cut files: SVG, DXF, AI, CDR, PDF, EPS, DWG</p>\n<p>📏 Dimensions:<br>\n• Individual house: 53 × 56 × 70 mm (≈ 2.1 × 2.2 × 2.8 in)<br>\n• Largest element: 227 × 322 mm (≈ 8.9 × 12.7 in)<br>\n• Full assembled tree: 663 × 450 mm (≈ 26 × 17.7 in)</p>\n<p>Assembly: Slot-fit structure – no glue required.</p>\n<p>Celebrate the countdown to Christmas with this enchanting Advent Calendar Tree — a perfect DIY project for laser artists, makers, and families who love festive traditions!</p>",
